,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322631721,"data":"And that the which we did think it is an hour\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322634979,"data":"In a full time we did.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322641187,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.32264389,"data":"SECOND GENTLEMAN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322646479,"data":"But since they were all this,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322659383,"data":"If it were there again by th’ other’s name.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322663899,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322667597,"data":"FIRST GENTLEMAN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322671012,"data":"Come, sir, be witness.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.3226748,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322678212,"data":"FIRST GENTLEMAN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322681349,"data":"Why, well, my lord.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322684536,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322687579,"data":"THIRD GENTLEMAN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322690697,"data":"Do you hear it?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322693917,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322696904,"data":"THIRD GENTLEMAN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322700102,"data":"Ay, madam, if they please, if they were not,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322703305,"data":"Not to be gone before, or have a cause\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322706438,"data":"For all our noble ones.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322709651,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322712651,"data":"CERIMON.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322715786,"data":"’Tis but a fair one,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322718982,"data":"To be a parish woman.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322722143,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322725151,"data":"CERIMON.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322728292,"data":"Well, well, sir,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322731573,"data":"I will be sworn upon a month, and now\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322737883,"data":"Descend the time with haste.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322740035,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322742429,"data":"CERIMON.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322753997,"data":"Well, come you hence?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322758018,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322761512,"data":"CERIMON.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322764889,"data":"And mine, my lord.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.32276902,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322772145,"data":"CERIMON.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322775237,"data":"Let us alone,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322778352,"data":"And to the state we have not seen a son\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322781495,"data":"So well as well as life. To th’ other hence,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322784699,"data":"And then to part in one consent, and not to know:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.32278791,"data":"All which is false, but none to live in time;\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322791139,"data":"But for our love I did begin to hope\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322794411,"data":"That we shall be as, if our King have known us:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322797636,"data":"Therefore some comfort are they all be married,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322808312,"data":"And in this hand of us we are in debt.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322811605,"data":"We are a happy man; we would depart\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322814812,"data":"To make our cousines, as we shall meet,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322818093,"data":"Ourself and our most noble father.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322821377,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322824565,"data":" [_Exit a Lord._]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322830322,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322832354,"data":"PERICLES.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322834586,"data":"Who is that?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322846297,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322849989,"data":"CERIMON.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322853618,"data":"His son?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322857355,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322861105,"data":"THAISA.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322864763,"data":"The Lord of Tyre,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322867916,"data":"I’ll have some part of your great feast.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322871539,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322874625,"data":" [_Exit._]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322877761,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.32288074,"data":"PERICLES.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322883897,"data":"Now, good my lord, your mistress is become,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322887198,"data":"And you, my\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322890327,"data":"== scale-S-7M-shakes-only: done in 97.8 min\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322893583,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322896609,"data":"======== GPU 1 log ========\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.32289981,"data":"r hands,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322902879,"data":"And when they were as black as it were,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.32290606,"data":"As they should hale, they say, what a man\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322909232,"data":"Will never be, but I’ll be angry.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322912445,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322915482,"data":"CAPTAIN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322918678,"data":"To know ’tis true.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322925287,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322927323,"data":"PROVOST.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322929857,"data":"Be patient for a maid’s life to weep;\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322941604,"data":"And yet she is not come out, which will a tongue\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322945709,"data":"Be so untrue, that it cannot be a word.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322949457,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.32295334,"data":"CAPTAIN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322956474,"data":"That’s nothing.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322959663,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322962703,"data":"PROVOST.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.32298011,"data":"That’s so, my lord.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322983767,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322986824,"data":"CAPTAIN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.322990577,"data":"No, not all this.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323001779,"data":"They are the servants that are married here.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323005202,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323008938,"data":"CAPTAIN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323012072,"data":"So you do, my lord; I’ll swear you have.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323015289,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323018324,"data":"CAPTAIN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323021504,"data":"I have a lady, and your ladyship.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323025474,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323029084,"data":"CAPTAIN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323032872,"data":"You do not love me?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323036804,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323040795,"data":"CAPTAIN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323044666,"data":"They are made of one that you should love you better.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323048017,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323051042,"data":"CAPTAIN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323054162,"data":"We have not found you, sir! I see you will do better.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.32305741,"data":"You look so low as you can be. I am a woman\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323060649,"data":"That can not think of any woman’s face\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323065244,"data":"By any reason of this quality.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323068439,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323071517,"data":"CAPTAIN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323074624,"data":"I never saw so fair a lady.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323077797,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323080877,"data":"CAPTAIN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323084055,"data":"I pray you, what’s your ladyship?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323087233,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323090319,"data":"CAPTAIN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.32309337,"data":"No, no.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323096527,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.32309959,"data":"CAPTAIN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323105957,"data":"A woman, madam, the youngest master.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323108118,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323110974,"data":"CAPTAIN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323123165,"data":"I cannot speak.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323127732,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.32313125,"data":"CAPTAIN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.323134999,"data":"I say, sir,\n"}
