,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324190215,"data":"best val loss 3.2192 (bpb 1.4692). sample:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324193435,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324196427,"data":"I have a pipe so far from all these hours\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.32419965,"data":"As to make me thankful.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324208188,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324211327,"data":"DIOMEDES.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324214482,"data":"You are too far\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324217577,"data":"Of this great lady’s name.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.32422079,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324223785,"data":"PROTEUS.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324227011,"data":"How?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324232779,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324234852,"data":"DIOMEDES.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324237072,"data":"I’ll make her amends.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324249559,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324253821,"data":"PROTEUS.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324257484,"data":"Go, get you gone.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324261472,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324265158,"data":"DIOMEDES.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.32426833,"data":"Here dwell you, madam; have you been at supper?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324271571,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324274576,"data":"PROTEUS.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324277738,"data":"Why, madam, did you so? There’s a merry night,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.32428094,"data":"That you must leave me.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324284113,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.32428718,"data":"PROTEUS.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324290307,"data":"Do I know that?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.32429347,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.32429659,"data":"PROTEUS.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324299672,"data":"I am not well enough.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324306355,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324309463,"data":"PROTEUS.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324312565,"data":"Do you hear this?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324315749,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324319027,"data":"PROTEUS.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324325266,"data":"No, my lord.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324327472,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324329458,"data":"PROTEUS.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324332334,"data":"No, no, ’tis very true.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324344659,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324348353,"data":"PROTEUS.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.32435209,"data":"Ay, and the next are well.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.32435591,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324359412,"data":"PROTEUS.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324362815,"data":"Why, madam, speak with me; I am sick\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324365957,"data":"Of my own sickness.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324369159,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324372154,"data":"PROTEUS.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324375252,"data":"I am sure I have not\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324378387,"data":"So fit a reason for myself to think me cured.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324381653,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324384674,"data":"PROTEUS.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324387769,"data":"I am asham’d for them; if not, my lord.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324390916,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324393885,"data":"PROTEUS.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324396914,"data":"I would you had been so. I have been with you,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324400098,"data":"And been a gentleman, and yet have been\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.3244033,"data":"Too sadly wish’d, you had forgot myself\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324406553,"data":"That you have been so foolish.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324409754,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324412802,"data":"PROTEUS.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324419505,"data":"Most true, my lord.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324421735,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.32442412,"data":"PROTEUS.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324439417,"data":"I never took it of your brother’s house.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324443086,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":21267.324446673,"data":"PROTE\n"}
